message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Citation is a request, not a license condition — see LICENSE-DATA (CC0-1.0)."
type: dataset
title: "enterovirus-genbank-curated: a curated, provenance-tracked GenBank Enterovirus sequence database"
authors:
  - family-names: Famulare
    given-names: Mike
version: "4.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-30"
license: CC0-1.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode"
keywords:
  - enterovirus
  - poliovirus
  - GenBank
  - genomic surveillance
  - curated database
abstract: >
  A curated, versioned view of publicly available GenBank Enterovirus sequence data —
  poliovirus (with Sabin 1/2/3 vaccine reference alignments) and non-polio enterovirus —
  with epidemiology-first metadata, full field-level curation provenance, and reference
  multiple-sequence alignments. See README.md for the reproducibility status of this release.
